@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Parametric arm-count finish
+
+`finish_rule=classify_only` is the byte-exact canonical rule.
+`finish_rule=classify_then_highlight_armiest` first runs that classifier, then
+counts red arm cells in each completed multicolor component and recolors the
+cyan room cells in the unique armiest component to color 4.
+
+Inputs are setting-independent. Requests support 2–6 demonstrations and 1–4
+prefix-stable queries; the fourth query is a substantive 30×30 case touching all
+four boundaries. `prototype.public_turn` exposes one current query with no
+settings, program, answer, future query, index, or total-query hint.
